<title>UK: Brazil Repackaged Bonds set 100 mln mark bond. [CORRECTED 15:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Brazil Repackaged Bonds set 100 mln mark bond. [CORRECTED 15:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRAZIL REPACKAGED BONDS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *13.00     MATURITY    15.APR.14</p>
<p> TYPE     STEP-DOWN   ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE  S-17.MAR.97</p>
<p> (Corrects pay date from 15 April to 17 March.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.00	REOFFER    99.75     LISTING    FFURT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  2.00</p>
<p> LIST FEE   0.50</p>
<p> NOTES     *UNTIL 15.OCT.99 THEN 9.375 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	   PAR CALL SEMI-ANUALLY FROM 15.OCT.99.</p>
<p>	   REDEMPTION IN EQUAL ANNUAL INSTALMENTS FROM 15.OCT.04</p>
<p>(Corrects redemption date from 15 October 1999 to 15 October 2004.)</p>
<p>	   S-SHORT FIRST AND LAST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
